        "created_at": "2021-09-18T12:43:07.898Z",
        "cooked": "<p>eyyyyy! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I do think C&amp;A had the right idea when they said that being nominated is basically the real win, and the rest is just who can mobilize their fanbase best. So us Letters Page listeners can pat ourselves on the back a bit, too. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
